  description: Centaurs are medium-sized hybrids, half human and half horse, with
    a strong tail and two pairs of hooves. They move fast, able to gallop and circle
    prey with ease, outrunning most armored hunters. They communicate mostly with
    animalistic sounds - snorts, stamping, whinnies - though their expressions and
    gestures can feel unsettlingly intelligent.
